<title>USA: Tolleson, Ariz., won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>Tolleson, Ariz., won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc  said it won $1.060 million of Tolleson, Ariz., general obligation, Series 1997 bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1018 percent.</p>
</text>
